earch Paper<\/small> <span class=\"units pull-right\">Units: 3<\/span><\/h1><p>Course consists of guided independent study resulting in a serious research paper. Students will work on their own, with meetings with faculty advisor[s] at weekly intervals.<\/p><p>Prerequisite: DS 481 ; Design Studies Majors<\/p><table class=\"table section-table table-striped table-condensed\" summary=\"This table details the sections of DS 483 based on the criteria submitted in the search form.\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Sec<span class=\"hidden-xs\">tion<\/span><\/th><th scope=\"col\">Comp<span class=\"hidden-xs\">onent<\/span><\/th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"class-num hidden-xs\">Class #<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Avail.<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Day\/Time<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Loc<span class=\"hidden-xs\">ation<\/span><\/th><th scope=\"col\">Instructor<\/th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"hidden-xs\">Begin\/End<\/span> Dates<\/th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"hidden-xs\">Topic<\/th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"screen-only\">Notes<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tfoot><tr><td colspan=\"6\"><a href=\"#container\">top<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot><tr><td>601<\/td><td>Lec<\/td><td class=\"class-num hidden-xs\">10779<\/td><td><span class=\"text-success\">Open<\/span><br \/>10\/20<\/td><td><ul class=\"weekdisplay\"><li class=\"open hidden-xs\"><abbr title=\"Sunday\">S<\/abbr><\/li><li class=\"meet hidden-xs\"><abbr title=\"Monday - meet\">M<\/abbr><span class=\"screen-reader-only-text\"> meets<\/span><\/li><span class=\"visible-xs print-only\">M <\/span><li class=\"open hidden-xs\"><abbr title=\"Tuesday\">T<\/abbr><\/li><li class=\"open hidden-xs\"><abbr title=\"Wednesday\">W<\/abbr><\/li><li class=\"open hidden-xs\"><abbr title=\"Thursday\">T<\/abbr><\/li><li class=\"open hidden-xs\"><abbr title=\"Friday\">F<\/abbr><\/li><li class=\"open hidden-xs\"><abbr title=\"Saturday\">S<\/abbr><\/li><\/ul> 9:35 AM  - 12:20 PM <\/td><td>Distance Education - Online<\/td><td><a href=\"http:\/\/directory.ncsu.edu\/users\/jswai